      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In practice, this bug is a problem for avatars that have pupils that are not centered within the eyeball and need different L/R rotation values.\n\nFace tracking respects the muscle limits set within the rig config so this isn't an issue if both eyes have the same rotation value.\n\nBut the avatar descriptor does not, leaving with no way to combat against this bug",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
